{"4182250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tit for Tat: A Game Theory Adventure", "steam_appid": 4182250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A multiplayer board game of trust, betrayal, and survival—where every choice shapes not just your fate, but everyone else’s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race up the winding path and claim the treasure! Three other treasure hunters are competing beside you, but don’t get too confident: <strong>first place earns the most, last place earns the least… and if even one player falls, <i>everyone</i> pays the price.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your party cooperate long enough for all of you to escape with a share of the riches?<br>Or will greed, spite, and betrayal send the entire board collapsing beneath your feet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/b8cbb25b79a329960584a5a462979836.poster.avif?t=1781039482\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/b8cbb25b79a329960584a5a462979836.webm?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/b8cbb25b79a329960584a5a462979836.mp4?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face off in the classic Prisoner’s Dilemma:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperate:</strong> you both earn a small reward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defect:</strong> earn a bigger reward <i>only if</i> your opponent cooperates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Both defect:</strong> everyone loses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules. Messy consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/33fbb102fc35afa930b3e328dec93ce2.poster.avif?t=1781039482\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/33fbb102fc35afa930b3e328dec93ce2.webm?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/33fbb102fc35afa930b3e328dec93ce2.mp4?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/d6434f1e0232243bd47da1635e5ff923.poster.avif?t=1781039482\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/d6434f1e0232243bd47da1635e5ff923.webm?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/d6434f1e0232243bd47da1635e5ff923.mp4?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take charge—or take the fall.</strong><br>Become the <strong>Dictator</strong> and decide the fate of your fellow players. Or step up as <strong>Captain</strong>, distributing the crew’s points for the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: the crew <strong>always votes</strong> on whether you deserve to stay in command.<br>Be unfair and you might get the boot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/e78e9e07fc223113066b6b18d221e68b.poster.avif?t=1781039482\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/e78e9e07fc223113066b6b18d221e68b.webm?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/e78e9e07fc223113066b6b18d221e68b.mp4?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A multiplayer board game of trust, betrayal, and survival—where every choice shapes not just your fate, but everyone else’s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race up the winding path and claim the treasure! Three other treasure hunters are competing beside you, but don’t get too confident: <strong>first place earns the most, last place earns the least… and if even one player falls, <i>everyone</i> pays the price.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your party cooperate long enough for all of you to escape with a share of the riches?<br>Or will greed, spite, and betrayal send the entire board collapsing beneath your feet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/b8cbb25b79a329960584a5a462979836.poster.avif?t=1781039482\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/b8cbb25b79a329960584a5a462979836.webm?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/b8cbb25b79a329960584a5a462979836.mp4?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face off in the classic Prisoner’s Dilemma:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperate:</strong> you both earn a small reward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defect:</strong> earn a bigger reward <i>only if</i> your opponent cooperates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Both defect:</strong> everyone loses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules. Messy consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/33fbb102fc35afa930b3e328dec93ce2.poster.avif?t=1781039482\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/33fbb102fc35afa930b3e328dec93ce2.webm?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/33fbb102fc35afa930b3e328dec93ce2.mp4?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/d6434f1e0232243bd47da1635e5ff923.poster.avif?t=1781039482\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/d6434f1e0232243bd47da1635e5ff923.webm?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/d6434f1e0232243bd47da1635e5ff923.mp4?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take charge—or take the fall.</strong><br>Become the <strong>Dictator</strong> and decide the fate of your fellow players. Or step up as <strong>Captain</strong>, distributing the crew’s points for the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: the crew <strong>always votes</strong> on whether you deserve to stay in command.<br>Be unfair and you might get the boot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/e78e9e07fc223113066b6b18d221e68b.poster.avif?t=1781039482\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/e78e9e07fc223113066b6b18d221e68b.webm?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/extras/e78e9e07fc223113066b6b18d221e68b.mp4?t=1781039482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A collapsing board. Greedy choices. Group consequences. Tit for Tat is a multiplayer board-game challenge where you battle through mini-games for treasure—but one player’s fall means everyone pays the price.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/eca64fa01e41d1b1728c8896687f3c0341ea3afa/header.jpg?t=1781039482", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/05895a4688435c0149e0826eed217c6517d57d77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781039482", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182250/05895a4688435c0149e0826eed217c6517d57d77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781039482", "website": null, "pc_requireme